          "s-cashews-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Add 2 walnuts.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-walnuts-1",
          "s-walnuts-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Add 10 to 12 raisins.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-raisins-1",
          "s-raisins-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Add 2 dried figs.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-fig-1",
          "s-fig-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Add 4 dates.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-dates-1",
          "s-dates-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Add 10 pistachios.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-pistachios-1",
          "s-pistachios-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Add 1 tbsp pumpkin seeds.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-pumpkin-1",
          "s-pumpkin-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Stir, then leave everything to soak overnight.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-soak-1",
          "s-soak-2",
          "s-soak-3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Next morning, pour the glass through a strainer.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-strain-1",
          "s-strain-2",
          "s-strain-3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Let the water drain out and throw it away.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-drain-1",
          "s-drain-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Tip the soaked nuts and fruit into the mixie jar.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-jar-1",
          "s-jar-2",
          "s-jar-3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Pour in the milk.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-milk-1",
          "s-milk-2",
          "s-milk-3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Add the honey.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-honey-1",
          "s-honey-2",
          "s-honey-3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Close the lid and blend until smooth and creamy.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-blend-1",
          "s-blend-2",
          "s-blend-3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Pour the shake into a tall glass.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-pour-1",
          "s-pour-2",
          "s-pour-3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Drink it fresh.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-serve-1",
          "s-serve-2"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "tags": [
      "no-cook",
      "blender"
    ],
    "credit": "ASMR Indian Chef",
    "notes": "Hindi speech: counts and amounts come from the voice (8 almonds, 4 cashews, 2 walnuts, 10 to 12 raisins, 2 figs, 4 dates, 10 pistachios, 1 tbsp pumpkin seeds). Milk amount (about 1 cup from the steel jug) and honey amount are my estimates. The part of the speech between draining and drinking was cut off, so the order of milk, honey and blending is from the pictures. After the milk, an amber liquid from a small bowl and then a thin stream from a squeeze bottle go in: I read both as honey (or a sweet syrup), so honey is marked optional. Soaking is overnight and is extra to the 10 minutes. The video then makes health claims (about weakness and tiredness): left out. A white chunk floats in the glass while pouring: not explained, ignore it."
  },
